"When Spotify desktop on this Mac plays an ad, relaunch it in the background, then resume via Spotify Connect." = "本机 Spotify 桌面版播放广告时，在后台重新启动，再通过 Spotify Connect 恢复播放。";
"When a Live Activity appears automatically." = "实时活动自动出现时的效果。";
"When a song only has line timing, listen to the music app's audio on this Mac to time each word, and share good results. Asks for audio access and downloads Apple's speech model once." = "歌曲仅有逐行时间轴时，分析本机音乐音频以生成逐字时间轴，并分享良好结果。需要音频访问权限，首次使用时下载 Apple 语音模型。";
"When another app is playing, show a Spotify source tab so you can switch medias. Hidden while Spotify itself is the main media source." = "其他应用播放时显示 Spotify 来源标签，方便切换媒体。Spotify 为主要来源时隐藏。";
"When enabled, 100% app volume is capped by current system output volume." = "启用后，应用音量 100% 对应当前系统输出音量上限。";
"When enabled, your Mac will stop using AC power and run from its battery until the battery limit is reached." = "启用后，Mac 停止使用外部电源，改用电池直至电量降至设定上限。";
"When more than one live activity is running, the ones after the first appear as small bubbles next to the notch, like the Dynamic Island. Click a bubble to open it." = "多个实时活动同时运行时，其余活动会像灵动岛一样以小气泡显示在刘海旁。点击气泡即可打开。";
"When re-opening the notch, it will return to the last menu you had open." = "重新打开刘海时返回上次打开的菜单。";
"When shown items would run into the app's menus or the notch, temporarily swap the menus out until the items hide again" = "显示的项目与应用菜单或刘海冲突时，暂时隐藏应用菜单，直至项目再次收起";
"When the notch is collapsed, swipe up over it to hide it completely. Swipe down near the notch area to bring it back." = "刘海收起时，向上轻扫可完全隐藏；在刘海附近向下轻扫可重新显示。";
"When this profile starts or ends here, do the same on Android." = "此处开始或结束配置时，在 Android 上执行相同操作。";
"When you drag a file out of the shelf, remove it from the shelf automatically." = "将文件拖出暂存架后，自动从架中移除。";
